# Images are built from the repo root. Dependencies are installed and code is built inside the
# image, so nothing built or installed on the host belongs in the context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/deploy/out
infra/deploy/secrets.*.env
design
docs
